  "sourceTitle": "Lemon, Ginger, Honey Tea [AIP, Paleo]",
  "sourceText": "Lemon, Ginger, Honey Tea [AIP, Paleo]\nBy: Paleo Flourish\nPublished: Tuesday, July 24, 2018 - 1:31am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup (240 ml) boiling water\n1/2 lemon, cut 3 slices and then squeeze the rest of the juice into the cup\n3 thin slices of ginger\nHoney to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place all the ingredients into a cup. 2 Steep for 5 minutes.\n\nAbout\n\nDESCRIPTION: Make this lemon ginger honey tea to soothe colds or just to enjoy.",
